<div id="skl"></div><div id="ban"></div><div id="fl"></div><div id="bio"></div><div id="xh"></div><div id="up"><h2>CHOOSE AN UPGRADE</h2><div class="row" id="cards"></div><p style="font-size:13px;opacity:.8">Click a card or press 1 / 2 / 3</p></div>
<div id="ov"><h1 id="t1">KILLERMANJARO</h1>
<p id="t2">Survive the wastes. Aim with the mouse, pick a ride, weapon and module. Clear waves for roguelike upgrades. Hull damage is permanent: only repair kits fix it. Wrecks drop scrap to spend in the SKILL TREE on permanent upgrades.</p>
